  "_comment": [
    "Labels are matched first on the localized messages (SERVICEDEFS.<CODE>), then on ServiceDef names and codes.",
    "These overrides are added on top, so the migration still resolves when an environment's localization is missing",
    "or differs (checked against UAT localization + DEV ServiceDefs on 2026-11-20).",
    "typeAliases: issue type label of Ticket Migration.xlsx -> menuPath / componentCode it stands for, per reporter type.",
    "source: old label -> old serviceCodes it covers (added to the codes found by label). A code listed here is used",
    "        even when the environment's MDMS no longer has it.",
    "target: new label -> serviceCode to use, when the new ServiceDef label differs from the workbook."
  ],
